              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used my own dry ranch dressing mix and I left out the seasoning salt, as I didn't want my crackers to be too salty. These turned out really good. I think they could use a little more spice but that's really a personal preferance. I made this with my oldest boy yesterday after dinner and so far, over half is gone! I think we'll be making this again real soon."
